WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.4 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Core policies: conduct, conflicts and anti-fraud

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Write a few short core policies before habits form, and share them from the first volunteer.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Cover conduct, conflicts of interest, fraud and harassment.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Declare interests, especially when friends and family help.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Ask everyone who joins to confirm they have read them.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You outline your core policies and how each will work from the start.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
